<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήν-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήνεος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (also <i><span class="en">
			<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
			130.26
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήν</span>):—
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging
				to a goose,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεῶν βοέων καὶ χηνέων πλῆθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					558a22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <u>PCair.Zen.</u> l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήνεια</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Menipp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.664e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.68.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.56
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήνεια ἥπατα,</span> a Greek
			dainty, <i>foie gras,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.384c
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνεία</span> shd. be read in
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				467
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
